xt-[#5A4E6D]\">—</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">—</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold bg-[#F3EEF7] text-[#8B7FA3]\">no operating rows yet</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#F0E8DC]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-2\"><a class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86] hover:underline\" href=\"/os/town/phuthaditjhaba\">Phuthaditjhaba</a></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">1</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">3</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">1</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold bg-[#E5F2EC] text-[#2F7D5C]\">moving</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-[#F0E8DC]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-2\"><a class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86] hover:underline\" href=\"/os/town/welkom\">Welkom</a></td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">—</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">—</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[#5A4E6D]\">—</td><td class=\"px-4 py-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold bg-[#F3EEF7] text-[#8B7FA3]\">no operating rows yet</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">Initiative patterns</h2><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/initiative/syn-init-fixeasy-senekal\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#5B2A86]\">FixEasy</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">Demand exists. Supply verification is the bottleneck.</p></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-[#EADFD2] bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#D9B27C]\" href=\"/os/initiative/syn-init-ecd-phuthaditjhaba\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#5B2A86]\">Green Streets ECD</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\">QwaQwa needs additional ECD operators — the gap is capacity, not demand.</p></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#8B7FA3]\">Interventions required — evidence-linked</h2><div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#EADFD2] bg-white shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Senekal is the province&#x27;s most evidenced town: verified proofs on the majority of its completed work.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#9DC9B4] text-[#2F7D5C]\">Evidence-linked</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86]\">Capability:</span> <!-- -->Senekal can carry provincial verification load.</p><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-301\">syn-proof-301</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-302\">syn-proof-302</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/proof/syn-proof-303\">syn-proof-303</a></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Next:</span> <!-- -->Appoint Senekal as Free State artisan verification hub<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Owner:</span> <!-- -->provincial lead<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Review:</span> <!-- -->next provincial review</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border p-5 border-[#EADFD2] bg-white shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#241A33]\">Phuthaditjhaba capacity gap: 44 children waiting on 8 missing verified ECD operators.</p><span class=\"shrink-0 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide border-[#9DC9B4] text-[#2F7D5C]\">Evidence-linked</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-[#5B2A86]\">Capability:</span> <!-- -->Capacity, not demand, is the provincial constraint.</p><div class=\"mt-2\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-601</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/mission/syn-work-602\">syn-work-602</a></span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-[#5A4E6D]\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Next:</span> <!-- -->Fund ECD operator verification round 2<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Owner:</span> <!-- -->provincial capacity desk<!-- --> · <span class=\"font-semibold\">Review:</span> <!-- -->after round 2</p></div></div></section><div class=\"mt-8\"><span class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-201</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#E7C9A0] bg-[#FDF3E3] px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] text-[#8A5410] hover:bg-[#F8E7CC]\" href=\"/os/town/klerksdorp\">syn-signal-601</a></span></div><section class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-[#D9C7EA] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F7F1FB] to-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#5B2A86]\">CHIEF OF STAFF</h2><p class=\"text-xs italic text-[#8B7FA3]\">Free State scope · five modes</p></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" rol